<% url = confirmation_url(@resource, confirmation_token: @token) %>
<% if @resource.try(:unconfirmed_email?) -%>
Please confirm <%= @resource.unconfirmed_email %> as the new email address for your Pharma Transport account:
<% else -%>
Welcome to Pharma Transport. Please confirm your email address so we can reach you about your account and your compliance records:
<% end -%>

<%= url %>

If you didn't create an account, you can ignore this email.
